<td id="A2.T7.5.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r"><span id="A2.T7.5.5.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">86.2</span></td>
<td id="A2.T7.5.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="A2.T7.5.5.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">22.9</span></td>
<td id="A2.T7.5.5.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r"><span id="A2.T7.5.5.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">25.2</span></td>
<td id="A2.T7.5.5.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="A2.T7.5.5.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1.27</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the results of AutoEdit applied to flow-based editing methods, as shown in Table <a href="#A2.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix B More results on flow-based editing ‣ AutoEdit: Automatic Hyperparameter Tuning for Image Editing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>. Specifically, AutoEdit is used to search for the optimal injection timestep, a key hyperparameter in both Taming Flow <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib42" title="" class="ltx_ref">42</a>]</cite> and Fireflow <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">6</a>]</cite>. Overall, AutoEdit enhances the baseline performance in terms of both background preservation and prompt alignment, demonstrating its effectiveness in automatically identifying hyperparameters that improve editing results.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T8" class="ltx_table ltx_align_floatright" style="width:47%;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 8</span>: </span><span id="A2.T8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">AutoEdit on global editing task</span></figcaption>
<table id="A2.T8.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T8.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T8.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:1.4pt;padding-right:1.4pt;"><span id="A2.T8.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Base model</span></th>
<th id="A2.T8.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:1.4pt;padding-right:1.4pt;"><span id="A2.T8.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Editing method</span></th>
<th id="A2.T8.5.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column" style="padding-left:1.4pt;padding-right:1.4pt;"><span id="A2.T8.5.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CLIP score</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A2.T8.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T8.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:1.4pt;padding-right:1.4pt;">SDXL</th>
<td id="A2.T8.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:1.4pt;padding-right:1.4pt;">DDPM-Inv <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib15" title="" class="ltx_ref">15</a>]</cite></td>
